sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as AI Agent / Client
    participant Host as Praxis proxy (host)<br/>port host-defined
    participant PPE as praxis-policy<br/>(in-process)
    participant IdP as OIDC IdP<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Valkey as Valkey<br/>6379/TCP RESP+TLS
    participant Vault as Vault<br/>8200/TCP HTTPS
    participant Upstream as Upstream Tool Server<br/>port host-defined

    Note over Host,Vault: Startup: secret resolution (Flow 3)
    PPE->>Vault: POST /v1/auth/{mount}/login<br/>Kubernetes SA JWT / AppRole (via host transport)
    Vault-->>PPE: Vault token
    PPE->>Vault: GET /v1/{mount}/data/{path}<br/>X-Vault-Token
    Vault-->>PPE: Secret (zeroized after use)

    Note over Agent,Upstream: Flow 1: tool call with identity, authorization, delegation
    Agent->>Host: Tool / resource / prompt / LLM / HTTP request<br/>HTTP(S), Bearer JWT (+DPoP) or API key
    Host->>PPE: pre-invocation hook
    PPE->>IdP: GET JWKS (cached, moka)<br/>HTTPS TLS, no auth
    IdP-->>PPE: Signing keys
    PPE->>PPE: Verify JWT / DPoP, resolve identity
    PPE->>Valkey: Read Session Taint (principal-bound session id)<br/>TLS (rustls), Valkey ACL
    Valkey-->>PPE: Taint labels
    PPE->>PPE: Evaluate APL + Cedar / CEL / OPA PDPs<br/>(decision cache, SHA-256 keys)
    PPE->>IdP: RFC 8693 token exchange<br/>client credentials + subject token
    IdP-->>PPE: Audience-scoped token
    PPE-->>Host: Allow + delegated token
    Host->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>Delegated scoped token
    Upstream-->>Host: Result
    Host->>PPE: result hook
    PPE->>PPE: Redact fields, update taint, emit audit event
    PPE-->>Host: Filtered result
    Host-->>Agent: Response

    Note over PPE,Valkey: Flow 2: out-of-band approval (CIBA)
    PPE->>IdP: POST back-channel auth<br/>client credentials
    IdP-->>PPE: auth_req_id
    PPE->>Valkey: Store correlation (optional)<br/>TLS, Valkey ACL
    loop Poll until approved / denied / expired
        PPE->>IdP: POST token endpoint<br/>client credentials + auth_req_id
        IdP-->>PPE: pending / tokens
    end
